Rule 1 (features must be a floating-point tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (dtype_(v_1) = 6) ∨ (dtype_(v_1) = 7) ∨ (dtype_(v_1) = 8)
>>
Rule 2 (name is a valid string when provided)
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 = v_2
>>
Rule 3 (tensor rank and shapes are valid)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (first dimension size is non-negative when rank > 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 6 (features cannot be boolean)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 8 (features have a well-defined value range)
{v_1 : tensor} |= min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
